{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\n\nIf the target loses power, uncommitted writes are lost out of order — which can corrupt the volume's structure, not just recent files. Choose this only if the target's cache is protected: battery-backed, on a UPS, or with its write cache disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n如果目标设备断电，未提交的写入可能无序丢失，既可能丢失新文件，也可能破坏整个卷的结构。仅当目标缓存具备电池或 UPS 保护，或已关闭写入缓存时，才应选择此设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " (the full LaunchServices scan is still running)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（LaunchServices 的完整扫描仍在进行）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Attached now: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 当前连接：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "!": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@\n\nForce Eject takes the volume away from whatever is using it. Anything those apps have not saved is lost, and a file being written at that moment can be left incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\n\n强制推出会立即断开正在使用此卷的应用。尚未保存的内容会丢失，正在写入的文件也可能不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %llu": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ (fell back from %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@（原接口 %2$@ 不可用，已切换）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already exists and is not a link, so it is left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已存在且不是符号链接，已保留原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already links to %@, so it is left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已链接到 %2$@，已保留原链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ could not be removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ did not finish within 20 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 在 20 秒内未完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ exited %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已退出，状态码为 %2$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 失败：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not this app's, and was left alone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 不属于此应用，已保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ links to this app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已链接到此应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — macOS's list of extensions leaves it out, but FSKit loads it (checked with a local test mount)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 未出现在 macOS 的扩展列表中，但本机测试确认 FSKit 可以加载它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. To remove it yourself: sudo rm %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@。如需手动移除，请执行：sudo rm %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld GB": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld GB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld bytes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 字节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(not resolved)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（尚未解析）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Nothing on the storage device itself is changed.** Your data stays where it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**不会更改存储设备上的任何内容。** 你的数据会保留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disk request did not match the device's block layout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘请求与设备的块布局不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few permissions are still needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还需要授予几项权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accept the Risk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接受风险"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add %@ Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 %1$@ 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加命令行链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an %@ target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 %1$@ 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the subsystem's allowed hosts on the storage device, or allow any host there. Namespace IDs start at 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在存储设备上，将此标识加入子系统的允许主机列表，或允许任意主机连接。命名空间 ID 从 1 开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the target's allowed initiators on the storage device, or allow any initiator there. It follows this Mac's name, so renaming the Mac changes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在存储设备上，将此标识加入目标的允许发起端列表，或允许任意发起端连接。此标识随 Mac 名称生成，更改 Mac 名称后也会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All installed modules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已安装模块"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An NVMe/TCP subsystem name starts with “nqn.”. For an iSCSI target, add one under iSCSI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVMe/TCP 子系统名称须以“nqn.”开头。如需添加 iSCSI 目标，请在 iSCSI 分组中添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another account on this Mac has this disk attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 上的另一个账户已挂载此磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the target which %@ it has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询目标提供的%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking the target…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查询目标…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach a target to open a session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载一个存储目标即可建立连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时自动挂载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login is turned off in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统设置中已关闭登录时自动挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login needs the app in /Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时自动挂载需要将应用放在 /Applications 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached under a target's earlier address, name or LUN, or for a target that has since been removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些磁盘使用目标编辑前的地址、名称或 LUN 挂载，或其对应目标已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaches by itself when you log in to this Mac. If the target can't be reached, keeps trying for 5 minutes, then shows a warning here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录此 Mac 时自动挂载。若目标无法访问，会持续重试 5 分钟，之后在此处显示提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching it from two accounts at once would corrupt it. Detach it in that account first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个账户同时挂载此磁盘会导致数据损坏。请先在另一个账户中断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching it from two accounts at once would corrupt it. Eject it in the other account, then attach it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个账户同时挂载此磁盘会导致数据损坏。请先在另一个账户中推出，再在此处挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching storage at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时正在挂载存储设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在挂载“%1$@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attempt enablement write": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试写入启用设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份验证（选填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic (macOS chooses)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动（由 macOS 选择）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background service installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Block size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "块大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "块数量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CHAP secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CHAP 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CHAP user": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CHAP 用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cached writes will be committed every %lld seconds and when the volume is detached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每隔 %1$lld 秒及断开时提交缓存中的写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cached writes will be committed every second and when the volume is detached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每秒及断开时提交缓存中的写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capacity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "容量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing the login item": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在更改登录项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for Updates…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查更新…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check that the background service is running and the filesystem extension is enabled, on the Setup screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请前往“初始设置”，确认后台服务正在运行，文件系统扩展已启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the CHAP username and secret, the initiator IQN or host NQN, and the target's access rules. The original response below identifies the specific refusal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查 CHAP 用户名和密钥、发起端 IQN 或主机 NQN，以及目标的访问规则。下方原始响应提供了具体拒绝原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the address, port and network interface, and confirm the storage device is online.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查地址、端口及网络接口，并确认存储设备在线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the network and storage device, then reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查网络和存储设备，再重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the target's protocol settings. Keep the original diagnostic below when reporting this issue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查目标的协议设置。反馈问题时，请保留下方原始诊断信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理注册信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close anything using the volume — including Finder windows and Terminal sessions inside it — and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请关闭正在使用此卷的应用，包括打开此卷的 Finder 窗口和终端会话，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commit writes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交写入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected — attached in another account, or still connecting — so the address, port, name and %@ can't change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标已连接，可能正由另一账户挂载或仍在建立连接，因此无法更改地址、端口、名称和%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not attach at login — %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时未能挂载：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not attach the LUN as a disk: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将 LUN 挂载为磁盘：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not attach “%@” at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时未能挂载“%1$@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not connect to the storage target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接存储目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not serve the LUN as a file, even after removing %lld stale copy(s) of the filesystem extension. Details: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已清理 %1$lld 个失效的文件系统扩展副本，仍无法将 LUN 提供为文件。详情：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not serve the LUN as a file: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将 LUN 提供为文件：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daemon (SMAppService)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务（SMAppService）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete saved targets and passwords": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除已保存的目标和密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete the folder in Finder once the app has quit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请退出应用后，在 Finder 中删除文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach All": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach again. If the storage device is unreachable, detaching waits for it to answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请再次尝试断开。如果存储设备无法访问，断开操作会等待设备响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach and Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开并安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach and Quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开连接并退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach it under Other Attached Disks, then attach again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在“其他已挂载磁盘”中断开此磁盘，再重新挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach it, then edit it. Nothing was saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先断开挂载，再进行编辑。本次更改未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach them — in each account that has one — and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在所有连接了卷的账户中断开连接，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach to change the address, port, name or %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先断开，再更改地址、端口、名称或%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detach volumes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开已挂载的卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detaching did not finish: %@ is still attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未完全断开：%1$@ 仍处于挂载状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detaching “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在断开“%1$@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disabled on the target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标端已停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discover": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disk Utility shows what is on it. Do not erase it unless you mean to delete what it holds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在“磁盘工具”中查看其中的内容。除非确实要删除其中的数据，否则请勿抹掉它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DiskImages2 attach failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DiskImages2 挂载失败：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DiskImages2 attach unavailable: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DiskImages2 挂载功能不可用：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DiskImages2 attached nothing for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DiskImages2 未能挂载 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't Quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Durability": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据持久性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each write is on stable media before it is acknowledged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次写入均在数据落入持久存储后才确认成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit the target: enter a host name, an IPv4 address or an IPv6 address, without brackets, and put the port in the Port field.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请编辑目标：填写主机名、IPv4 地址或不带方括号的 IPv6 地址，并将端口填入“端口”栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑“%1$@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eject": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eject and Detach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推出并断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eject “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推出“%1$@”？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable at Next Restart": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次重启时启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable the filesystem extension?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用文件系统扩展？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabled on the target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标端已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the CHAP secret first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先输入 CHAP 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the secret too, or clear the user — a name on its own does not verify anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请同时输入密钥，或清空用户名。仅填写用户名无法验证身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every %lld seconds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每隔 %1$lld 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every second": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything has been removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有内容已移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FSKit module (Backend A)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FSKit 模块（后端 A）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fail the connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中止连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Falls back to whatever macOS picks when this interface is missing or has no route, and tries it again at the next reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选接口不存在或没有可用路由时，改用 macOS 选择的接口；下次重连时会再次尝试原接口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filesystem extension enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件系统扩展已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filesystem extension registered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件系统扩展已注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish setting up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成初始设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish setup before adding targets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先完成初始设置，再添加目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish setup first — the background service and filesystem extension have to be running before a target can be attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先完成初始设置。后台服务和文件系统扩展运行后，才能挂载存储目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force Eject": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制推出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give up per-write durability?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭每次写入的持久性保障？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In use by another session on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 上的另一个账户正在使用此磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed in Applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已放入“应用程序”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing now would replace the filesystem extension that %@ is using, and anything writing to it at that moment would lose the process answering its reads and writes.\n\nThe update is downloaded and ready. It will install itself and relaunch the app as soon as the last volume is detached. Quitting the app installs it too, so a quit asks you to detach first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在安装会替换%1$@正在使用的文件系统扩展，正在写入该卷的程序会失去负责处理读写的进程。\n\n更新已下载就绪。断开最后一个卷后，将自动安装更新并重新启动应用。退出应用也会安装更新，因此退出前会要求先断开连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is on macOS's list of enabled extensions, and turns on the next time the system service that reads the list restarts — at the latest when this Mac restarts. Turning it on now would restart that service and disconnect what is mounted through it, in every account: %@. To turn it on without restarting the Mac, detach those, then choose Re-check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此扩展已加入 macOS 的启用列表，将在相关系统服务下次启动时生效；重新启动 Mac 即可完成。立即重启服务会断开所有账户通过它挂载的卷：%1$@。如需立即启用，请先断开这些卷，再点击“重新检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is on macOS's list, but the system service that reads the list could not be restarted: %@. Choose Enable to try again, or restart this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此扩展已加入 macOS 的启用列表，但相关系统服务无法重启：%1$@。请点击“启用”重试，或重新启动 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may still be starting up. Try again shortly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备可能仍在启动，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will appear by itself if the target answers. Otherwise check the target and press Attach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标恢复响应后会自动挂载。也可以检查目标设备，再点击“挂载”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its address, port, name or %@ can't change while it is attached: the app finds the mounted volume by them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载期间无法更改地址、端口、名称或%1$@，应用需要依靠这些信息定位已挂载的卷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its settings and saved CHAP secret are removed from this Mac. Nothing on the target changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅移除此 Mac 保存的目标设置和 CHAP 密钥，不会更改目标设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its settings are removed from this Mac. Nothing on the target changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅移除此 Mac 保存的目标设置，不会更改目标设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its volume is still mounted and will be ejected first; anything still using files on it — a running virtual machine, an open document — should be shut down before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此卷仍处于挂载状态，移除前会先推出。请先关闭正在使用其中的文件的应用，例如虚拟机或打开的文档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its volume is still mounted. Detaching will eject the volume first; anything still using files on it — a running virtual machine, an open document — should be shut down before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此卷仍处于挂载状态，断开时将先推出卷。请先关闭正在使用其中的文件的应用，例如虚拟机或打开的文档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the original diagnostic below and report this issue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请保留下方原始诊断信息并反馈此问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept on this Mac's disk, encrypted, only while the target is attached. Takes effect the next time it is attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在目标挂载期间保存在此 Mac 的磁盘上，并加密存储。下次挂载时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LUN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LUN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LUNs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LUN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading targets…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在加载存储目标…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move App to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将应用移到废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mutual CHAP secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双向 CHAP 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mutual CHAP user": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双向 CHAP 用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVMe/TCP": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "NVMe/TCP subsystems list themselves to any host that can reach the port. Whether this Mac may attach is decided per subsystem by its host NQN, shown when you edit the target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何能访问端口的主机都能发现 NVMe/TCP 子系统。此 Mac 是否有权连接，由各子系统根据主机 NQN 决定；可在编辑目标时查看该标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Namespace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命名空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Namespace ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命名空间 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Negotiated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "协商参数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络接口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never uses another interface — not Wi-Fi, not a VPN. If this one is unavailable, the connection fails.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终只使用所选接口，不切换到 Wi-Fi 或 VPN 等其他接口；此接口不可用时连接失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never — target cache is non-volatile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不主动刷新（目标缓存须具备掉电保护）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No %@ targets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚无 %1$@ 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Active Sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
