            "value": "请打开“初始设置”，查看尚未完成的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Adds a link in /usr/local/bin so iscsictl runs from any Terminal, for every account on this Mac. macOS asks for an administrator's password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选：在 /usr/local/bin 中添加命令链接，供这台 Mac 上的所有账户在任意终端运行 iscsictl。macOS 会要求输入管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Proves the target is who it claims to be.": {
      "localizations": {
