            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some devices require credentials before they will list their targets. Leave these empty if yours does not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分设备需要验证身份后才会列出目标。如果设备没有此要求，请留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some things could not be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分内容未能移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still attached: %@. Quitting would install the update under it. Detach it — in each account that has one — and quit again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有连接：%1$@。退出会在其仍然连接时安装更新。请在所有连接了卷的账户中断开连接，然后再次退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still trying to attach after 5 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已重试挂载 5 分钟，仍未成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subsystem": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subsystem NQN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子系统 NQN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect the next time this target is attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次挂载此目标时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is an NVMe/TCP subsystem name. Add it under NVMe/TCP instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 NVMe/TCP 子系统名称，请在 NVMe/TCP 分组中添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ is attached as %@ and has no filesystem on it yet, which is normal for a new %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已连接为 %2$@，尚未创建文件系统。对于新的 %3$@，这是正常情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ is attached as %@, and it is not empty, but macOS did not mount a volume from it. It may use a filesystem macOS cannot read, be encrypted and locked, or still be checking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已连接为 %2$@，其中已有数据，但 macOS 未能挂载其中的卷。它可能使用了 macOS 无法读取的文件系统、已加密且处于锁定状态，或仍在进行检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app could not move itself to the Trash: %@ Finder is showing it — drag it to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用无法自行移到废纸篓：%1$@ 已在 Finder 中显示，请手动拖入废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is staying open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用将继续运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app itself goes last: when everything else is removed, a button moves it to the Trash and quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后处理应用本身：其他内容全部移除后，可点击按钮将应用移到废纸篓并退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background service is unregistered and the filesystem extension is turned off. An iscsictl link is removed if this app added one, which needs an administrator's password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将注销后台服务并停用文件系统扩展。若此应用创建过 iscsictl 链接，也会将其移除；此步骤需要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the storage target was interrupted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与存储目标的连接已中断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the target may have dropped. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与存储目标的连接可能已中断，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device answered, but is not offering any targets to this initiator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备已响应，但没有向此发起端提供任何目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device may be restarting or rebalancing. Try connecting again shortly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备可能正在重新启动或调整存储分布，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extra copies were removed. Quit and reopen the app, then try again. If a disk image of an older version is still mounted in Finder, eject it first — that is usually where the extra copies come from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多余副本的注册信息已清理。请退出并重新打开应用后重试。如果 Finder 中仍挂载着旧版本的磁盘映像，请先推出它；重复注册通常由此产生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The filesystem extension mounted but produced no LUN file at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件系统扩展已挂载，但未在 %1$@ 生成 LUN 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link could not be added: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法添加链接：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original diagnostic below contains the device's status and any suggested remedy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下方原始诊断信息包含设备返回的状态及相关处理建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage device is not ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储设备尚未就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage device rejected a request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储设备拒绝了请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage operation could not be completed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储操作未能完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage target did not complete a request in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标未能及时完成请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage target ended the connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标主动结束了连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage target refused this Mac's login.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标拒绝了此 Mac 的登录请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage target requested a different connection address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标要求改用其他地址连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage target returned an incompatible response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储目标返回了不兼容的响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target has %@s %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标提供的%1$@：%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target has %@s %@; %@ is not one of them. Choose one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标提供的%1$@：%2$@，其中不包含 %3$@，请选择有效编号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target has one %@: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标仅提供一个%1$@：%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target reports no %@s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标未提供任何%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update installs when the app quits, and installing replaces the filesystem extension that %@ is using.\n\nDetach first, or keep the app open and quit later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出应用时将安装更新，并替换%1$@正在使用的文件系统扩展。\n\n请先断开连接，或保持应用运行，稍后再退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The volume is in use, so it was not ejected. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卷正在使用中，无法推出。%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's host NQN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 的主机 NQN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's initiator IQN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 的发起端 IQN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account's saved targets and stored passwords are deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除当前账户保存的目标和密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection is no longer active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此连接已失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This daemon was built with DEBUG and accepts XPC connections from any process. Never ship it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此后台服务是 DEBUG 构建，会接受任何进程的 XPC 连接。请勿将其作为正式版本使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disk is already attached, under the settings the target had before it was edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此磁盘已按编辑前的目标设置挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes macOS's registration of the copies listed above so only this one is used. It does not delete any files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将移除上面列出的副本在 macOS 中的注册信息，只保留当前副本。不会删除任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This stops the background service and starts it again, and disks attached through it lose their connection — eject them first, in each account that has one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会停止并重新启动后台服务，通过它连接的磁盘将断开连接。请先在所有连接了磁盘的账户中推出这些磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This stops the background service running from the other copy and starts it from this one. Disks attached through it lose their connection — eject them in Finder first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将停止另一副本的后台服务，并从当前副本启动。通过它挂载的磁盘会断开，请先在 Finder 中推出这些磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This target caches writes and write-through is off. Data acknowledged as written may not survive a power loss.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此目标启用了写入缓存，但未启用直写。即使写入已确认成功，断电时仍可能丢失数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off the filesystem extension": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停用文件系统扩展"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning it on means restarting a system service, which would disconnect what is mounted through it on this Mac, in every account: %@. Detach those, then choose Re-check — or choose Enable at Next Restart and restart this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用此扩展需要重启系统服务，会断开此 Mac 所有账户通过它挂载的卷：%1$@。请先断开这些卷再点击“重新检查”，或选择“下次重启时启用”并重新启动 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning on the login item": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启用登录项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unregister": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use These Credentials": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用这些凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use another interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用其他接口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the address in the original response below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请使用下方原始响应中提供的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify the target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证目标身份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is ready. It will install and relaunch once every volume is detached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 版已就绪。断开所有卷后将安装更新并重新打开应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ will install after you detach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开所有卷后将安装 %1$@ 版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volumes are unmounted first, and nothing is forced. If something is using a volume, removal stops and says so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首先卸载已挂载的卷，不会强制推出。若有卷正在使用中，移除操作会停止并说明原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for it to finish and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待操作完成后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接口不可用时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write safety": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入安全"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write-through": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes will be acknowledged while they are still in the target's volatile cache. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据仍在目标设备的易失性缓存中时，就会确认写入成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved targets and their passwords will be deleted. Nothing on the storage device itself is touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除已保存的目标和密码，不会改动存储设备上的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a volume is still mounted there: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有卷挂载于此：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a volume that is attached": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已挂载的卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "already registered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "an attach or detach is still running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接或断开操作仍在进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "approved, but not answering — the daemon is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已批准，但后台服务未运行，无法响应"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "atomic replace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原子替换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "connected as %@ — no volume mounted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接为 %1$@ — 未挂载任何卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "connected as %@ — not formatted yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接为 %1$@，尚未格式化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "connected as %@ — “%@” is encrypted and locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接为 %1$@ — “%2$@”已加密且处于锁定状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not ask FSKit: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法查询 FSKit：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not create %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not delete %@ in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法删除 %2$@ 中的 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not enable it: %@. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启用：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not load DiskImages2.framework": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法加载 DiskImages2.framework"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not serialize: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法序列化：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "could not tell whether it is enabled: a local test mount failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机测试挂载失败，无法确认扩展是否启用：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "detached %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已断开 %1$lld 个连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "disabled and unregistered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停用并注销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "diskutil did not run": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能运行 diskutil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "enabled (checked with a local test mount; macOS's list of extensions leaves it out)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用（macOS 的扩展列表中未显示，但本机测试挂载成功）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "enabledModules.plist is not an array of strings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "enabledModules.plist 的内容不是字符串数组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失败：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hdiutil did not run": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能运行 hdiutil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator is not set to open at login, so nothing will attach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未将 iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 设为登录时打开，因此不会自动挂载目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator needs a background service to hold the connection to your storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 需要后台服务来保持与存储设备的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator wants to add the iscsictl command to /usr/local/bin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 希望将 iscsictl 命令添加到 /usr/local/bin。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator wants to remove the iscsictl command from /usr/local/bin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 希望从 /usr/local/bin 移除 iscsictl 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator will add its filesystem extension to the list macOS keeps of enabled extensions, at\n\n~/Library/Group Containers/group.com.apple.fskit.settings/enabledModules.plist\n\nNothing else on that list is changed, and nothing is restarted now, so nothing mounted is disconnected. The extension turns on the next time the service that reads the list restarts — at the latest when this Mac restarts.\n\nThis is normally done by the switch in System Settings, but that switch does not work on this version of macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 将把自身的文件系统扩展加入 macOS 的已启用扩展列表，文件位于：\n\n~/Library/Group Containers/group.com.apple.fskit.settings/enabledModules.plist\n\n列表中的其他项目不会改变，也不会立即重启任何服务，因此已挂载的卷不会断开。负责读取此列表的服务下次重启时，扩展就会启用；最迟会在这台 Mac 下次重新启动时生效。\n\n这项操作通常由“系统设置”中的开关完成，但该开关在当前 macOS 版本中无法正常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator will add its filesystem extension to the list macOS keeps of enabled extensions, at\n\n~/Library/Group Containers/group.com.apple.fskit.settings/enabledModules.plist\n\nand then restart the system service that reads it. Nothing else on that list is changed.\n\nRestarting that service disconnects everything mounted through it, in every account on this Mac — this app's volumes, and on this version of macOS also FAT and exFAT drives. Nothing like that is mounted right now; if something is by the time you confirm, the restart is skipped and you will be told what is in the way.\n\nThis is normally done by the switch in System Settings, but that switch does not work on this version of macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator 将把自身的文件系统扩展加入 macOS 的已启用扩展列表，文件位于：\n\n~/Library/Group Containers/group.com.apple.fskit.settings/enabledModules.plist\n\n随后将重启负责读取此列表的系统服务。列表中的其他项目不会改变。\n\n重启该服务会断开这台 Mac 上所有账户通过它挂载的卷，包括本应用的卷，以及当前 macOS 版本中的 FAT 和 exFAT 磁盘。目前没有此类卷处于挂载状态；如果确认时发现有卷正在使用，将跳过重启，并告知阻碍原因。\n\n这项操作通常由“系统设置”中的开关完成，但该开关在当前 macOS 版本中无法正常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in-place (atomic replace failed: %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原位写入（原子替换失败：%1$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iqn.2026-08.com.example:disk0": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "iscsictl on the command line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令行中的 iscsictl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lsregister not present at the expected path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预期位置没有 lsregister"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS %@ has a bug that leaves the File System Extensions switch stuck off for third-party extensions, so it has to be enabled another way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS %1$@ 存在问题，第三方文件系统扩展的开关无法开启，需要采用其他方式启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 26.x fallback": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26.x 兼容方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has not registered the extension inside this app yet. This usually resolves itself a moment after the app is moved or launched; if it does not, registering explicitly fixes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 尚未注册此应用内的扩展。移动或启动应用后通常稍等即可；若仍未完成，可点击“注册”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is waiting for you to allow the background service in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在系统设置中允许此后台服务运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs your permission to run the filesystem extension. Turn on “iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator” under File System Extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 需要你的许可才能运行文件系统扩展。请在“文件系统扩展”中开启“iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS started the background service from %@ again instead of this copy. Remove or clean up that copy, then quit and reopen this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 再次从 %1$@ 启动了后台服务。请移除或清理该副本，再退出并重新打开当前应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still does not list the extension after re-registering. Quitting and reopening the app usually settles it; if not, drag the app out of Applications and back in. (tried: %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新注册后，macOS 仍未列出此扩展。请先退出并重新打开应用；若仍无效，将应用移出“应用程序”文件夹后再移回。（已尝试：%1$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS's list of extensions leaves it out, and a local test mount failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 的扩展列表中没有此模块，本机测试挂载也失败了：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "namespace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命名空间"
          }
        }
