            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除，已保留另一个账户保存的目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@ (%@), pid %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在运行 %1$@（构建 %2$@），进程 ID：%3$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@ but this app is %@ — needs re-registering": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务版本为 %1$@，应用版本为 %2$@，需要重新注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@, pid %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在运行 %1$@，进程 ID：%2$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from %@. A LaunchDaemon has to be reachable before anyone logs in, and it runs as root from wherever this app lives — so the app needs to be in /Applications, which only an administrator can change, rather than in your home folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前运行位置为 %1$@。后台服务需要在用户登录前可用，并以 root 权限运行，因此应用应放在仅管理员可修改的 /Applications 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from a temporary read-only copy (App Translocation). Move it to Applications and reopen — a daemon registered from here would point at a path that disappears.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前正从临时只读副本运行（App Translocation）。请移至“应用程序”后重新打开，否则后台服务将指向可能消失的路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from another copy of the app at %@ — needs reinstalling from this one": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务正在从另一个应用副本 %1$@ 运行，需要从当前副本重新安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "still attached: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有连接：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "still in use: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍在使用：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the LaunchDaemon plist is missing from the app bundle (packaging bug)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用包缺少 LaunchDaemon 配置文件，请重新安装完整应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the app's code signature is not valid for this. Reinstall by dragging from the DMG.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用的代码签名无效，无法执行此操作。请从磁盘映像重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service belongs to another copy of the app at %@; it needs reinstalling from this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务属于另一个应用副本 %1$@，需要从当前副本重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is approved but not running — most often because it belongs to a copy of the app that no longer exists. Reinstall it from this copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务已获批准但未运行，通常是因为它指向的应用副本已不存在。请从当前副本重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is kept until it has deleted the saved passwords. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已保存的密码删除之前，将保留后台服务。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is version %@ but this app is %@; it needs reinstalling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务版本为 %1$@，当前应用版本为 %2$@，需要重新安装后台服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon does not implement the protocol": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务不支持此通信协议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon replied with nothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务未返回任何内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon sent a reply this version cannot read (%@). This usually means the app and the background service are different versions; the Setup screen can reinstall it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务返回了当前版本无法读取的响应（%1$@）。这通常表示应用与后台服务的版本不一致；可在“初始设置”页面重新安装后台服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon stopped mid-call": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务在请求过程中中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the extension is not registered yet — that step has to pass first": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展尚未注册，请先完成注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the system still reports it as registered (status %lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统仍显示服务已注册（状态 %1$lld）"
